<title>USA: TRW Inc Q1 sales, net and oper share rise.</title>
<headline>TRW Inc Q1 sales, net and oper share rise.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollar Amounts In Millions Except For Per Share Data)</p>
<p>					     1997		    1996</p>
<p>FIRST QUARTER</p>
<p>Sales				   $2,659.6		 $2,513.8</p>
